msgstr "Comment=desolat, conessei pas aquesta sinhal."

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:1
msgid "Name=End user"
msgstr "Name=Usuari final"

msgid ""
"Name=You might want to send a bug report to the author. Please include as "
"much information as possible, maybe the original documents. If you have a "
"way to reproduce the error, include this also."
msgstr ""
"Name=Podser voletz enviar un informe d'error a l'autor. Se vos plau, incluietz "
"tanta informacion que ei possible, podser los documents originals. Se "
"tenietz ua manera de reproduir l'error, incluietz-la tamben."

#: kdebase/drkonqi/presets/enduserrc:2
msgid "Comment=Settings preferred for end users"
msgstr "Comment=Arranjament preferit pels usuaris finals"

msgid ""
"Comment=An application mostly receives the SIGILL signal due to a bug in the "
"application. The application was asked to save its documents."
msgstr ""
"Comment=Ua aplicacion recep lo sinhal SIGILL deut la major part deus "
"cops a un error de l'aplicacion. E li demana que salva los seus documents."

msgid ""
"Comment=An application terminates with a SIGABRT signal when it detects an "
"internal inconcistency caused by a bug in the program."
msgstr ""
"Comment=Ua aplicacion acaba amb ua sinhal SIGABRT quant detecta ua "
"inconsistènça interna causada per ua error dèu programo."

msgid ""
"Comment=An application mostly receives the SIGFPE signal due to a bug in the "
"application. The application was asked to save its documents."
msgstr ""
"Comment=Ua aplicacion recep lo sinhal SIGFPE dèut la major part dèus "
"cops a un error de l'aplicacion. E li demana que salva los sens documents."

msgid ""
"Comment=An application mostly receives the SIGSEGV signal due to a bug in "
"the application. The application was asked to save its documents."
msgstr ""
"Comment=Ua aplicacion recep lo sinhal SIGSEGV dèut la major part "
"dèus cops a un error de l'aplicacion. E li demana que salva los sens "
"documents."

